The standards
The nutrient values in data/ are reported from three published standards:
- National Research Council (2006), Nutrient Requirements of Dogs and Cats;
- AAFCO (2026), Official Publication (Dog and Cat Food Nutrient Profiles);
- FEDIAF (September 2025), Nutritional Guidelines.
Each value cites its table or page. These publications belong to their publishers and are
not reproduced here; read them for the full text. Where a note quotes a standard, the
quotation is a short phrase with its source. CC0 does not extend to the publishers' rights.
This project is not affiliated with, or endorsed by, NRC, AAFCO or FEDIAF.

Status
The rules in this repository are the provisional steward's proposal, pending ratification
by a governance body. This is a non-normative reference implementation of the proposed
computation, not a ratified standard.
